WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.002
Shall we, future Mrs. G.?

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.087
I love you.

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:11.803
The detective knows
what I really am.

00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:12.930
Are you alright?

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.432
-Do you need my help?
-Well, that's just it.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:18.101
Apparently it seems
that she's fine with it.

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:19.478
Listen, detective.

00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:22.689
What does it mean when a
woman recoils at your touch?

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:25.025
It means that they hate you.

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:26.735
Would you like to go out
with me this evening?

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:28.278
Every day he remains
on Earth,

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:30.030
people are in danger.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.908
The devil must go back
to hell.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.995
And the only person who
can send him there is you.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:43.335
Lucifer!

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.672
-I'm sorry.
-Oh, sorry.

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:48.715
I didn't realise
I'd left it so loud.

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:50.425
I'll get it. No, I've got
it, detective. Don't worry.

00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:51.260
Ow!

00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:52.719
Damn.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:54.763
How is it that sometimes
you don't get hurt

00:00:54.847 --> 00:00:56.765
and then other times you do?

00:00:56.849 --> 00:00:58.600
What is the difference?

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.854
I'm only vulnerable
when I'm close to you.

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:03.355
Detective, what's this?

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.483
-Nothing.
-Oh, right.

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:07.442
Well, if it's nothing,

00:01:07.526 --> 00:01:09.027
you won't mind me
drinking it then, will you?

00:01:09.111 --> 00:01:10.320
Don't drink it.
It's perfume.

00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:11.446
I've had worse.

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:12.698
No, don't!

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:13.949
For a moment,

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:16.952
I was helping him try to
send you back to hell.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.123
How could you do that to me?
To me?

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:23.166
Because I'm terrified!

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:31.466
You are the actual devil.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.845
Could you accept me
like this?

00:01:35.721 --> 00:01:36.972
I don't know.

00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:42.686
Then I have my answer.

00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:44.438
Tonight, we won,

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:46.982
but we just plucked one hole
in a very flimsy boat.

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:50.611
Now the demons know I've
no intention of returning,

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.197
they'll continue to defy me.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.364
I see.

00:01:55.199 --> 00:01:56.408
So, what are you saying?

00:02:00.913 --> 00:02:01.997
I have to go back.

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:05.042
You were right.

00:02:06.043 --> 00:02:08.587
About the prophecy.
We did get it wrong.

00:02:09.338 --> 00:02:11.465
It is about hell coming
to Earth,

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:14.092
and we may have stopped it
now, but for how long?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.221
I need to keep them
contained.

00:02:17.304 --> 00:02:19.097
They must have a king.

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:22.559
Please don't go. I…

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:26.021
I love you.

00:02:28.565 --> 00:02:29.608
We were wrong about
something else

00:02:29.691 --> 00:02:30.776
in the prophecy.

00:02:34.321 --> 00:02:35.948
My first love was never Eve.

00:02:40.202 --> 00:02:41.370
It was you, Chloe.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.414
It always has been.

00:03:01.223 --> 00:03:02.224
Hello, detective.

00:03:02.891 --> 00:03:03.892
It's really you.

00:03:07.229 --> 00:03:08.105
How?

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:09.648
It's a funny story,
actually.

00:03:10.274 --> 00:03:11.942
So, there I was in hell
and--

00:03:15.404 --> 00:03:18.615
When I found out about this…
manipulation,

00:03:18.699 --> 00:03:20.325
I felt the same way as you.

00:03:21.159 --> 00:03:24.288
Then I realised that
it's far from a curse.

00:03:24.371 --> 00:03:25.247
It's a gift.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:28.584
There is
a huge difference, Lucifer.

00:03:29.293 --> 00:03:31.503
You were given a gift.

00:03:31.587 --> 00:03:33.422
I am that gift.

00:03:34.006 --> 00:03:35.215
I want us to be together.

00:03:35.799 --> 00:03:36.758
I really do.

00:03:38.468 --> 00:03:39.511
I just don't…

00:03:40.429 --> 00:03:41.805
I don't know how long
it's going to take me

00:03:41.889 --> 00:03:42.764
to get over this.

00:03:42.848 --> 00:03:44.183
Take all the time you need.

00:03:44.766 --> 00:03:46.435
If you choose

00:03:47.186 --> 00:03:49.354
to be vulnerable around me,

00:03:53.775 --> 00:03:56.111
then I choose to be
vulnerable around you.

00:04:20.135 --> 00:04:21.553
I'm just wondering

00:04:22.846 --> 00:04:25.557
if, subconsciously,
you might be pushing me away

00:04:25.641 --> 00:04:28.519
because you say that
you want this

00:04:28.602 --> 00:04:30.646
and you say that
you want us, but…

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.233
-But do you?
-Where is this coming from?

00:04:34.858 --> 00:04:36.109
Well, if mojo-wise,

00:04:36.735 --> 00:04:38.612
you're no longer
letting me in,

00:04:39.696 --> 00:04:42.366
If now you're… invulnerable

00:04:42.449 --> 00:04:45.118
all the time,
doesn't that mean you're…

00:04:45.702 --> 00:04:48.789
no longer choosing to
be vulnerable with me?

00:04:49.873 --> 00:04:52.417
You deserve to hear
those three words back.

00:04:54.628 --> 00:04:56.547
I'll never be able
to say them to you.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.549
There's no way
you're incapable of love.

00:04:58.632 --> 00:05:00.926
No one is incapable of love,
no one.

00:05:01.009 --> 00:05:02.261
Azrael!

00:05:02.344 --> 00:05:04.555
With the angel of death
at our side, I can't lose.

00:05:04.638 --> 00:05:05.722
I'm sorry, Lu.

00:05:07.766 --> 00:05:08.642
No.

00:05:10.352 --> 00:05:11.228
I got it!

00:05:12.104 --> 00:05:12.896
Chloe!

00:05:13.981 --> 00:05:15.232
Chloe!

00:05:19.278 --> 00:05:20.445
No, no, no.

00:05:22.906 --> 00:05:24.157
This is all my fault.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.994
I love you.

00:05:27.077 --> 00:05:28.453
I'm going to get her back!

00:05:28.537 --> 00:05:29.955
Lucifer, come on.

00:05:30.581 --> 00:05:33.292
Your banishment. You'll die
if you try to go to heaven.

00:05:33.959 --> 00:05:35.711
So be it.

00:05:35.794 --> 00:05:36.879
Lucifer,

00:05:38.213 --> 00:05:39.381
what are you doing here?

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:41.508
I've come to get you.

00:05:41.592 --> 00:05:42.926
It's not your time.

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:44.928
You need to come back.

00:05:45.512 --> 00:05:47.014
The… the war and…

00:05:47.097 --> 00:05:49.558
-Yes.
-And I left Trixie.

00:05:50.976 --> 00:05:52.603
-And my friends.
-Yeah.

00:05:53.312 --> 00:05:54.188
And I left you.

00:05:54.271 --> 00:05:56.106
Ok. Wait!

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.274
How do we get back?

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.444
I'm not sure we can.

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:03.739
I'm afraid there's
not enough power left

00:06:03.822 --> 00:06:04.781
for the both of us.

00:06:15.501 --> 00:06:16.585
I choose…

00:06:17.169 --> 00:06:18.420
you because…

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:22.633
I love you.

00:06:27.721 --> 00:06:28.639
Lucifer.

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:30.307
Lucifer!

00:06:42.653 --> 00:06:43.487
We have a daughter.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:47.950
We have a daughter.

00:06:48.659 --> 00:06:51.370
What if it's because
you've become God?

00:06:52.454 --> 00:06:53.330
No.

00:06:53.872 --> 00:06:56.083
No, no. My father
chose to be distant.

00:06:56.166 --> 00:06:57.543
I would never choose this.

00:06:58.126 --> 00:07:00.546
When Rory said that
you weren't at my deathbed,

00:07:01.755 --> 00:07:03.257
you know, I still had that…

00:07:04.341 --> 00:07:05.801
That's impossible.

00:07:06.385 --> 00:07:09.429
Lucifer would never
abandon me.

00:07:09.972 --> 00:07:12.349
But, reading this,
I realise…

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:13.392
Of course you would.

00:07:13.475 --> 00:07:15.686
You've done it
so many times before.

00:07:16.979 --> 00:07:18.564
-Have I?
-Yes!

00:07:18.647 --> 00:07:21.275
Every time we've had
an emotional breakthrough,

00:07:21.358 --> 00:07:24.111
you've immediately gone off
and disappeared.

00:07:24.194 --> 00:07:25.279
And now

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.657
you've told me you love me,
it's…

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:31.910
the biggest breakthrough
we've ever had.

00:07:33.245 --> 00:07:34.121
So I just wonder

00:07:34.204 --> 00:07:36.623
how do I know
you won't follow it up with…

00:07:38.792 --> 00:07:40.544
My biggest ever
disappearing act.

00:07:42.337 --> 00:07:43.380
Today's the day.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:45.549
What day?

00:07:46.592 --> 00:07:47.509
August 4th.

00:07:48.468 --> 00:07:50.679
The day that
Rory says you disappear.

00:07:52.472 --> 00:07:54.057
I know this is
what I'm meant to do

00:07:54.141 --> 00:07:56.059
and I know
that it feels right.

00:07:57.269 --> 00:07:58.437
It's my calling.

00:07:59.313 --> 00:08:00.189
Lucifer.

00:08:00.814 --> 00:08:02.649
-Well, maybe I don't need--
-Lucifer.

00:08:03.567 --> 00:08:04.443
Listen.

00:08:07.279 --> 00:08:09.656
If you're feeling
any doubt at all,

00:08:10.532 --> 00:08:13.243
remember that we are doing
this for Rory's sake.

00:08:13.827 --> 00:08:15.162
I don't want to leave you.

00:08:18.457 --> 00:08:20.083
I don't want you to leave,
either.

00:08:21.376 --> 00:08:22.503
You can't see me.

00:08:24.796 --> 00:08:25.881
But I'm right here.

00:08:29.426 --> 00:08:31.220
And it'll be the same
down there.

00:08:35.766 --> 00:08:37.351
No matter where you go.

00:08:38.477 --> 00:08:39.978
No matter where you are.

00:08:41.939 --> 00:08:43.106
I'll be with you.

00:08:44.733 --> 00:08:46.193
I'll be with you always.

00:08:47.027 --> 00:08:48.779
I'm going to miss you,
honey.

00:08:48.862 --> 00:08:50.822
Mum, I'm an angel, remember?

00:08:53.492 --> 00:08:54.952
I'll see you
on the other side.

00:08:55.536 --> 00:08:56.703
It's a date.

00:09:12.094 --> 00:09:13.178
Are you ready to go home?

00:09:29.695 --> 00:09:30.779
Hello, detective.

00:09:31.446 --> 00:09:32.906
I thought
you could use a partner.

